<title>FINLAND: NEWS CONFERENCE ON PARTEK-SISU DEAL 1500.</title>
<headline>NEWS CONFERENCE ON PARTEK-SISU DEAL 1500.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A news conference about the announced merger between Partek Oy Ab and Sisu Oy will be held today, Wednesday January 22 at 1500/1300 GMT, at Hotel Strand Intercontinental, a spokeswoman at the ministry of trade and industry said by telephone.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
